# Barreletics Design System — section library (HARD)

**The repository is the Design System.** GitHub / `shopify-build/` = master. Shopify = disposable QA runtime only. Brian integrates production from the approved repo.

## Contract (authority)

- **Frozen inventory:** `planning/m4-section-library-CONTRACT.md` (ARCHITECTURE APPROVED 2026-07-26)
- Proposal history: `planning/m4-section-library-architecture.md` (superseded)
- Final theme = **only** the approved production library — replace legacy; no duplicate generations

## Source of truth + QA

1. Build section in repository  
2. Commit (GitHub master)  
3. QA in disposable draft — push **only** when Andrew names a theme ID in that message  
4. Revise in repository (never Theme Editor as master)  
5. Approve → freeze in repo → next  
6. Brian pulls approved repo → production  

See `.cursor/rules/shopify-draft-theme-only.mdc`.

## Locked decisions (abbrev)

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Heroes | **No artificial hero cap** — distinct capabilities only |
| Naming | `home-split-hero` → **`split-hero`**; collection → **`collection-split`** |
| Companions | **`sole-cards`** = own section (not permanently coupled) |
| Statement | **`statement-band`** standalone; full-bleed = separate sections |
| PDP | **`pdp-features` kept** — not merged into `fifty-fifty` |
| Reviews | One **`reviews`** section |
| GEO | Inside **`studio-trust`** |
| Newsletter | Footer **and** standalone `newsletter` |
| Campaign | `campaign-stage` **deferred** |
| variant-grid | KEEP logic non-negotiable |

## Build gate

1. No production section code until CONTRACT acknowledged  
2. **First after contract:** `split-hero` only until frozen  
3. One section at a time thereafter  

## Architecture (every major component)

| Requirement | Rule |
|-------------|------|
| File | Own `sections/*.liquid` |
| Schema | Complete + `presets` |
| Editor | Independently draggable / removable / reusable |
| Shared | `snippets/` + shared assets only |
| Coupling | No section depends on another |
| Scope | No monolithic `page-*` long-term |

## Anti-patterns

- Multiple new sections in one pass  
- Developing in Shopify as primary source  
- Treating Theme Editor / remote theme as master  
- Homepage-only Liquid/CSS; sibling hard dependencies  
- Building past `split-hero` before it is frozen  

## Shopify

Disposable draft QA only with explicit theme ID in-message. `187143618851` retired. Never live/production.
